  "method": [
    "Local Linux Release, real service, Router and managed Worker. Alternating groups baseline A, candidate A, candidate B, baseline B. Each group starts a fresh Worker and executes the same three distinct tip heights in order. Each preview freezes its accepted prefix and executes one feature. One sample per group has a cold Worker, followed by two same-predecessor edits.",
    "For historical growing fixtures both sides use a test-only overlay fixing the predecessor evaluator generation. Final result keys are isolated per run. The baseline uses the original service implementation and binary. Equality is enforced per corresponding preview for BREP, Naming and the service visual artifact.",
    "Reported times are milliseconds; nested phases must not be added. Process peak RSS is a high-water mark. Absence of association_restore_ms means the loader did not run. STEP uses one independent 456-face import per arm. A separate current-generation production test exercises STEP, promotion and cold replay."
  ],
